+# Rigging
+
+## Specs directory
+
+`features/`
+
+## Implementation paths
+
+`js/` `index.html` `css/`
+
+## Tiers
+
+| Tier | Tag | Sweep | Budget |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| fast | `@logic` | `npx cucumber-js --tags "@logic and not @sandbox"` | 30s |
+
+## Verify
+
+Run a given set of scenarios:
+
+```sh
+SS_SCENARIO="<scenario references>" npx cucumber-js --require features/support/**/*.js --require features/step_definitions/**/*.js
+```
+
+## Prove
+
+Run a given set of scenarios (same as verify for this project):
+
+```sh
+SS_SCENARIO="<scenario references>" npx cucumber-js --require features/support/**/*.js --require features/step_definitions/**/*.js
+```
+
+## Sweep
+
+Run a tier's full set:
+
+```sh
+npx cucumber-js --tags "@logic and not @sandbox" --require features/support/**/*.js --require features/step_definitions/**/*.js
+```
+
+## Plank join
+
+```sh
+npx @ast-grep/napi scan --pattern '**/*.js' --pattern '**/*.mjs' --json '/// @planks("$$$PATTERN")' 2>/dev/null || echo "plank-join: ast-grep not available"
+```
+
+## Run record
+
+`none`
+
+## Test framework
+
+`@cucumber/cucumber` with `happy-dom` for DOM testing.
\ No newline at end of file
